*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% PPD file for HP LaserJet Pro M102a (M101-M106 Series)
*% Custom optimized URF/Raster driver for macOS CUPS
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "2.1"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "HPM102A.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*Product: "(HP LaserJet Pro M102a)"
*ModelName: "HP LaserJet Pro M102a"
*ShortNickName: "HP LaserJet Pro M102a"
*NickName: "HP LaserJet Pro M102a (Custom Driver)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "23"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*APAirPrint: True
*APAirPrintVersion: 1.5
*APURFVersion: 1.4
*APAcceptsMixedURF: True
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsSNMPSupplies: False
*cupsSingleFile: True
*cupsFilter2: "image/urf image/urf 10 -"
*cupsFilter: "image/urf 10 -"
*cupsMaxCopies: 99
*cupsBackSide: Normal

*OpenUI *Collate/Collate: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Collate
*DefaultCollate: False
*Collate True: "<</Collate true>>setpagedevice"
*Collate False: "<</Collate false>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Collate

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 18/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *cupsPrintQuality/Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *cupsPrintQuality
*DefaultcupsPrintQuality: Normal
*cupsPrintQuality Draft/Draft (EconoMode): "<</cupsInteger1 3 /HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
